	Instalation ..

	Very easy this time hehe.. Just copy DirWorx + DirWorx.info +
	this docfile! to any place on your harddrive..

	Copy the BBSCmd/Dir.info to your BBSCmd directory and you
	are ready to go..

	Wait you say.. where can I configure? Hahaha, there is no
	configuration! DirWorx reads everything it needs from your
	AmiExpress Icons..

